ok endlessly so it might be there and I do not see it. That was one of the reasons I was asking for possible clarification.<br /> The other situation is using scale a Psion is a scale 2 character. So if scale is the lifting chart does that mean you can lift a scale 2 object?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6424,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","user":"Fuzzykuma","date":". 01-11-2019, 03:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}